["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊马斯克、机器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形机器人最难的环节不是走路，是穿针剥虾</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">双足行走和自主导航都能沿袭特斯拉自动驾驶的积累，精准力控和触觉不能——那要模拟人的皮肤，开车时根本用不到。第一版、第二版机器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"1. 和投资人梦秋聊聊加州、投资寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持币待购\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>资本寒冬不是缺钱，是大家都在持币待购</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「资本寒冬」每两三年就被喊一次，通常六到八个月就过去。这次不一样：两头在外的美元通路被打断，不是没钱，而是不知道该怎么投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">资本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"串台《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成长起来？ UP 值 UG 中台 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下长大，靠的不是产品而是体系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节赢在体系而非个人：推荐算法、UG 中台、商业化三套系统叠加 Musical.ly 的产品壳，再用对标 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空档全面压制：TikTok 花 100 亿美元砸出护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是钱和一条暗号：几年间投入约 100 亿美元买量、补贴内容、砸服务器，对手要拦至少得准备 200 到 300 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字节跳动</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊贵的客户，直到日活破亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推广预算每个季度增长 100% 以上；Facebook 认定它留存太差、留不住用户，反而把流量导给它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]